    "primary_source": "Chromium RTCRtpReceiver schedules MaybeShortCircuitEncodedStreams when encoded streams are not required. With neither encoded streams nor a transform in the creation task it starts bypassing the transform; the later setter does not undo that bypass. Actual supplied Chrome156 behavior independently confirmed this cause."
  },
  "implementation": [
