    "Unsupported optional RTP metadata disables reports while retaining passthrough forwarding. Worker queues remain bounded to one outstanding receipt and16ms report intervals.",
    "Feature detection, an existing foreign transform, stale callbacks, close, worker startup failure and stream failure keep explicit fallbacks."
